(D) Corollary 5.5 and the continuation premise (two actors, theta=-1, delta=.9)
   (i) exchangeable lottery continuation: mirrored strategy gives the punished normalized relative value +0.000000 (= 0, as the corollary needs)
   (ii) label-dependent continuation (target gets -10 w.p. .5 whatever it does): normalized value -8.1818; deviation worth 4+delta*V = -69.64 < 0 -> cooperation sustained among relative actors
       -> the premise is exchangeability of the whole continuation (payoffs and transitions invariant under relabelling), not stage symmetry
